{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22365","headline":"读邓鲂诗 · 白居易","name":"读邓鲂诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尘架多文集，偶取一卷披。\n未及看姓名，疑是陶潜诗。\n看名知是君，恻恻令我悲。\n诗人多蹇厄，近日诚有之。\n京兆杜子美，犹得一拾遗。\n襄阳孟浩然，亦闻鬓成丝。\n嗟君两不如，三十在布衣。\n擢第禄不及，新婚妻未归。\n少年无疾患，溘死於路岐。\n天不与爵寿，唯与好文词。\n此理勿复道，巧历不能推。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22365.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22365","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}